ge badge-danger\\\">' + o.status + '</span>' : '') + `</td>\n      <td><b>` + o.company + `</b></td>\n      <td>` + o.bizno + `</td>\n      <td>` + o.rep + `</td>\n      <td>` + o.zip + `</td>\n      <td>` + o.addr + `</td>\n      <td>` + o.phone + `</td>\n      <td class=\\\"industry-cell\\\">` + (o.industry || '<span style=\\\"color:#999\\\">(미등재-공란)</span>') + `</td>\n      <td>` + o.dae + `</td>\n      <td>` + o.jung + `</td>\n      <td>` + o.so + `</td>\n    </tr>`).join('') + `\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>`;\n\nfs.writeFileSync(path.join(todayDir, '배현명_실사DB_200개기업_NICE검증_최종본.html'), htmlContent, 'utf-8');\nconsole.log('Saved HTML visual report successfully.');\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\import_company_database_list","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":10000,"toolAction":"Generating all final TSV, CSV, and HTML files","toolSummary":"Generate final files"}}]}
